title: Sons of God – Angels, Satan and the Sons of God
description: Angels and the sons of God: the sons of God are believers by faith and never angels, the giants of Genesis 6 and the sons of God in Job, what angels are and our being equal unto the angels, Satan a created being and our accuser, devils and false exorcisms, and the Nephilim and serpent seed fables, from the teachings on angels.
output: lessons/doctrine/topic-angels.html
highlight: angel; sons of God; Satan

# One deck for the doctrine "Angels and the sons of God" (9 teachings), its themes given equal weight.
# Slide text is the author's own sentences, trimmed. The verses the teachings typed out are shown from the KJV.

=== Introduction
--- Sons of God [title]
overline: Doctrine · Angels and the sons of God
heading: Sons of God
sub: Who the sons of God are (believers by faith, never angels), and what the Bible says of angels and Satan.
refs: John 1:12; Hebrews 1:5; Genesis 6:4; Job 1:6; Hebrews 1:14; Ezekiel 28:15
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

=== The sons of God are believers
# from 6578, 15859
--- Power to become the sons of God
kicker: The sons of God are believers
big: John 1:12 | mark: to them gave he power to become the sons of God, even to them that believe on his name
p: Believers. Those that call upon the name of the Lord. Those born again into the promise, adopted sons, heirs to the Kingdom of the Lord. The only way to become a son of God is by faith in THE Son of God.
p: *Then began men to call upon the name of the LORD* ([[Genesis 4:26]]). Abraham rejoiced to see His day ([[John 8:56]]). They were sons of God by faith in God's promise, Christ, the Lamb slain from the foundation of the world, long before the cross.

# from 6579, 15859
--- Unto which of the angels?
kicker: The sons of God are believers
big: Hebrews 1:5 | mark: unto which of the angels said he at any time, Thou art my Son
p: At no time has God called angels His sons. Angels, while higher created beings than man, are below man in our dominion as sons of God ([[Hebrews 2:5-7]]). They aren't heirs to the promise. They are not partakers with Christ; they but serve God and His heirs, or rebel and tempt and accuse.
p: Angels are spirit, not flesh, and not made in the image and likeness of God ([[Genesis 1:26-27]]).

# from 15859, 6578
--- Giants in the earth
kicker: The sons of God are believers
big: Genesis 6:4 | mark: There were giants in the earth in those days; and also after that
p: The sons of God in Genesis 6 are believers from Seth's line, who called on the Lord, marrying ungodly women, leading to wickedness. The giants were already there before these marriages, not produced by them. The children born after became “mighty men,” not hybrids.
p: God blames *the wickedness of man* for the Flood ([[Genesis 6:5]]), not angels or their offspring. And angels don't marry ([[Matthew 22:30]]).

# from 16842, 15859
--- Satan came also among them
kicker: The sons of God are believers
big: Job 1:6 | mark: the sons of God came to present themselves before the LORD, and Satan came also among them
p: The sons of God here are the spirits of those saved by faith in Christ, in heaven, where only the redeemed enter as sons ([[Hebrews 12:22-23]]). Satan is an angel. A rebellious angel, a cherub. And he came among them, as a separate entity than them. Not as one of them.

# from 15859, 6578
--- When the morning stars sang
kicker: The sons of God are believers
big: Job 38:7 | mark: When the morning stars sang together, and all the sons of God shouted for joy
p: The “corner stone” is Jesus ([[Ephesians 2:20]]), and this is His triumph, seen outside time. The morning stars are angels; the sons of God are the faithful, who rejoice in Christ's day as Abraham did.
p: God is not the author of confusion. If your interpretation of scripture causes a contradiction, then it's wrong.
read: app:doctrine-angels~15859 | The sons of God are believers, never angels
read: app:doctrine-angels~6579 | Angels are not sons of God
read: app:doctrine-angels~16842 | The sons of God came before the Lord

=== What angels are
# from 6579
--- Ministering spirits
kicker: What angels are
big: Hebrews 1:14 | mark: Are they not all ministering spirits, sent forth to minister for them who shall be heirs of salvation?
p: Angels are servants of God, ministers to us that are saved in Christ. We are His children, His sons. What love He has for us! Amen.

# from 17118
--- Equal unto the angels
kicker: What angels are
big: Luke 20:36 | mark: they are equal unto the angels; and are the children of God, being the children of the resurrection
p: The Sadducees tried to paint a contradiction into the resurrection of believers, with a woman married to seven brothers. Jesus answered that we aren't taken in marriage in the glorified eternal life awaiting us.
p: Go back and read the verse again. Jesus is describing us. What we will be like. Undying children of God.

# from 17927
--- The angel of the LORD
kicker: What angels are
big: Isaiah 37:36 | mark: Then the angel of the LORD went forth, and smote in the camp of the Assyrians
p: Hezekiah and Isaiah tore their clothes and cried out to God for deliverance. God considered His pleasure, promises and plans, and destroyed the army before the gates. *For I will defend this city to save it for mine own sake, and for my servant David's sake* ([[Isaiah 37:35]]).
p: Many times God delivers us out of mercy and grace. But sometimes it is His pleasure, promises and plans that He responds to.

=== Satan and devils
# from 6522
--- Satan was created
kicker: Satan and devils
big: Ezekiel 28:15 | mark: Thou wast perfect in thy ways from the day that thou wast created, till iniquity was found in thee
p: Satan is a created being. There was a day where Satan was created. Some believe the devil is some sort of balance to God, or the Mormons say Jesus' brother. These are blasphemous statements. Satan is a creature, Jesus the Creator.
p: Hell was created for Satan and the others who rebel with him ([[Matthew 25:41]]). Knowing his fate, he sought to bring down man with him. But God already had a plan of salvation for fallen man: the lamb slain before the foundation of the world.

# from 16842, 6522
--- The accuser of our brethren
kicker: Satan and devils
big: Revelation 12:10 | mark: the accuser of our brethren is cast down, which accused them before our God day and night
p: Satan goes to and fro in the earth, and walks up and down in it ([[Job 1:7]]). Christians should remember that he continues this practice today. He is our adversary, the god of this world, and our accuser before the Lord.
p: His resentment is in those sons of God, that God so loved us that He gave His only begotten Son for us.

# from 16141
--- False exorcisms
kicker: Satan and devils
big: Matthew 12:45 | mark: the last state of that man is worse than the first
p: Most Catholic “exorcisms” are fraudulent, performative and made up, like their “apparitions.” The swept house left empty is the problem with any false gospel exorcism ([[Matthew 12:43-44]]). Real deliverance is a quiet affair, and the goal is to get the person cleaned AND saved.
p: Possession only affects the unsaved; the Spirit within the saved prevents this.

# from 17416
--- Nephilim and serpent seed
kicker: Satan and devils
big: 2 Peter 2:3 | mark: with feigned words make merchandise of you
p: “Nephilim,” “serpent seed” and other false doctrines about angels and demons that men use to make merchandise of simple people are not Biblical, and hurt the cause of Christ.
p: Mindful of what the Bible says (and does not say), we can counter the claim of half-human hybrids.
read: app:doctrine-angels~6522 | Satan was created, and the gap theory is false
read: app:doctrine-angels~17416 | Nephilim and serpent seed are not biblical

=== What manner of love
--- What Manner of Love [title]
overline: Angels and the sons of God
heading: What Manner of Love
big: 1 John 3:1 | mark: Behold, what manner of love the Father hath bestowed upon us, that we should be called the sons of God
center: We are His children, His sons. What love He has for us! Amen.
